<title>USA: Westland, Mich. won by EVEREN.</title>
<headline>Westland, Mich. won by EVEREN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities, said it won $6 million of Westland, Mich., 1996 water &amp; sewer system revenue bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.028 percent.</p>
